==== InsertAmmoSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played during reloading.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
InsertAmmoSound = DoubleBarrelShotgunInsertAmmo,
</syntaxhighlight>
